      "source_xml_line": 1323,
      "string_id": "mil_zoneguard_common1_0",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "Is there a cook around here?",
      "JA_current": "ここにコックはいるか？",
      "JA_new": "この辺にコックはいるか？",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "mil_zoneguard_common1",
          "phrase_id": "0",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_military.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_military:mil_zoneguard_common1_1#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_military",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_military.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 1326,
      "string_id": "mil_zoneguard_common1_1",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "Sure is, how could we do without one! What the heck do you need him for, anyway?",
      "JA_current": "ああもちろん、いなけりゃどうにもならんよ！ いったいなんだ？ 何で彼を？",
      "JA_new": "いるさ。いなきゃ困るだろ！そいつに何の用だ？",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "mil_zoneguard_common1",
          "phrase_id": "1",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_military.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_military:mil_zoneguard_common1_2#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_military",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_military.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 1329,
      "string_id": "mil_zoneguard_common1_2",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "Well, I need a little bit of food.",
      "JA_current": "いやあ、少し食い物が欲しくてな。",
      "JA_new": "ちょっと食い物が欲しいんだ。",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "mil_zoneguard_common1",
          "phrase_id": "2",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_military.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_military:mil_zoneguard_common1_3#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_military",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_military.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 1332,
      "string_id": "mil_zoneguard_common1_3",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "He's in his kitchen. Usually, he sits there and mutters.",
      "JA_current": "奴はキッチンにいるぜ。大抵、そこに座ってブツブツ言ってんだ。",
      "JA_new": "厨房にいるよ。いつも座って、ぶつぶつ言ってる。",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "mil_zoneguard_common1",
          "phrase_id": "3",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_military.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_military:mil_zoneguard_common1_4#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_military",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_military.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 1335,
      "string_id": "mil_zoneguard_common1_4",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "Mutters?",
      "JA_current": "ブツブツ？",
      "JA_new": "ぶつぶつ？",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "mil_zoneguard_common1",
          "phrase_id": "4",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_military.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_military:mil_zoneguard_common1_5#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_military",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_military.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 1338,
      "string_id": "mil_zoneguard_common1_5",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "What did you expect? A drunk is a drunk. If he couldn't cook, we'd have gotten rid of him a long time ago. He's in the kitchen. I'll tell you how to get there.",
      "JA_current": "何を想像する？ 飲んで飲みまくりさ。もしあいつがコックじゃなかったら、とっくの昔に叩き出してる。あいつは厨房にいるよ。そこへの道筋を教えよう。",
      "JA_new": "何を期待してたんだ？酔っぱらいは酔っぱらいさ。料理ができなきゃ、とっくに追い出してる。厨房にいる。道を教えてやるよ。",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "mil_zoneguard_common1",
          "phrase_id": "5",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_military.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_military:mil_zoneguard_common1_6#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_military",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_military.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 1341,
      "string_id": "mil_zoneguard_common1_6",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "Thanks for the information.",
      "JA_current": "情報をありがとよ。",
      "JA_new": "教えてくれてありがとう。",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "mil_zoneguard_common1",
          "phrase_id": "6",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_military.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_military:mil_zoneguard_common1_7#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_military",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_military.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 1344,
      "string_id": "mil_zoneguard_common1_7",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "No problem.",
